CHAPTER VI
GUIDANCE AND SUPERVISION
Article 26
The Regional Government shall conduct guidance and supervision of the implementation of protection for women victims of violence.
The guidance as referred to in paragraph (1), includes: guidelines and fulfillment standards;
technical guidance and training;
provision of facilities;
monitoring; and evaluation The supervision as referred to in paragraph (1), shall be conducted with the principles of: professional;
transparent; and accountable.
